{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415732","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415732","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1041573201:1":{"text":"This place is nice. Honestly, anywhere beats that dead-as-a-doornail library.","source_cn":"这地方可真不错，当然了，跟死气沉沉的图书馆相比，哪里都好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E18EB893F5346DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573202:1":{"text":"...Hm? The sweet, briny tang of dragon egg essence, mixed with a trace of... the Dark Forest. Very unique.","source_cn":"……嗯？稀奇的味道。龙蛋液的腥甜底下，掺着一缕……薄暮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0725F5F5DB5B1302","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573203:1":{"text":"Ugh... S-Sal'thorin!","source_cn":"唔……萨……萨洛克兰？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF21DAA9C7404DC81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573204:1":{"text":"That's it! \"The Complete Notes of Esperia\" says you're from that mysterious underground kingdom, aren't you?","source_cn":"没错，检索了《伊索米亚见闻记录大全》，你来自那座神秘的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0CC6ADDF8E735B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573205:1":{"text":"You're sharp. But it sometimes invites perils.","source_cn":"过人的敏锐，同时也是多余的危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE6A572EFEA0A025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573206:1":{"text":"Easy, little one. The rules say \"keep it down in the library\". They can't police a bit of small talk in this corner.","source_cn":"别紧张呀小家伙。莱希拉姆的校规只管书架间不准喧哗，可管...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE92A3778CF1F432","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573207:1":{"text":"I'm just curious—when that queen who's lived for over a thousand years drinks dragon egg essence... does she take it with sugar or with salt?","source_cn":"我只是好奇，那位活了上千岁的女王，享用龙蛋液时，是喜欢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BF950E901ACF929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573208:1":{"text":"Mind your words.","source_cn":"你应当注意言辞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8D9C3CA5750D14F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041573209:1":{"text":"Too much curiosity does no one any good.","source_cn":"好奇心过盛毫无益处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFA53AB39FC5C6E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041573210:1":{"text":"Alright, alright. To show I'm acting in good faith, I'll trade you a top secret about the school rules.","source_cn":"好吧好吧，为表诚意，我用一条重量级的校规秘密和你交换。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98CD9CFF93532060","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573211:1":{"text":"Like... Article 41, Clause 2: No sneezing in alchemy class!","source_cn":"比如……校规第四十一条第二款，炼金课禁止打喷嚏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2A43B0FCC61C90A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041573212:1":{"text":"Want to know why? Answer my question and I'll tell you. Fair deal, no?","source_cn":"想知道原因吗？跟我说说就告诉你，这笔买卖怎么样，很划算吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE318B6F1E4CC838","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041573213:1":{"text":"The Queen has given me life, not the right to gossip about her preferences.","source_cn":"女王的恩典赋予我生命，而非谈论她喜好的权利。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE524544319C20A4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041573214:1":{"text":"Enough of your blasphemy, Hypogean.","source_cn":"妄言适可而止，恶魔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCE6229191FD0EA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041573215:1":{"text":"Alright, alright. I'll ask something trivial instead.","source_cn":"哎呀，别生气嘛，那换一点无关紧要的问题好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7644E932AB39DAC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041573216:1":{"text":"With a lifespan like yours, when do you typically retire?","source_cn":"既然你们萨洛克兰人的寿命那么长，那一般多少岁退休呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4014997D673A709A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041573217:1":{"text":"Do you get weekends off or... three days off a week?","source_cn":"一周是双休还是三休？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x208B50C330A7C976","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041573218:1":{"text":"No comment.","source_cn":"……无可奉告","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE809AC8471950A3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041573219:1":{"text":"Tch. Boring. Might as well go prank some first-years.","source_cn":"唉，无趣！还不如回去找几个新生捉弄一下呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D02E1ED1A811228","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041573220:1":{"text":"Anything's more interesting than talking to a rock with legs.","source_cn":"至少比跟一块会走路的硬石头聊天有意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DBBD7CD7502C083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:康缇丝":{"text":"Contess","source":"康缇丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:都铎":{"text":"Thador","source":"都铎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":2}}